  "body": "This integrates the PPISP post-processing module with gsplat's simple_trainer.py, extending the current post-processing implementation and adding the ability to load image metadata from EXIF.\r\n\r\nPPISP refers to the work titled \"PPISP: Physically-Plausible Compensation and Control of Photometric Variations in Radiance Field Reconstruction\"\r\nFor more information, see here:\r\n[Project website](https://research.nvidia.com/labs/sil/projects/ppisp/)\r\n[Paper](https://research.nvidia.com/labs/sil/projects/ppisp/assets/ppisp_arxiv_v1.pdf)\r\n[Code](https://github.com/nv-tlabs/ppisp)",
